Type: Package
Package: campsisqual
Title: Campsis Qualification Package
Version: 1.6.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nicolas", "Luyckx", email = "nicolas.luyckx@lynxsoft.be", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Calvagone", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Run the qualification of the Campsis suite and issue an IQ/OQ report in PDF (rendered with LaTeX). In addition, qualify the implementation of a Campsis model against the predictions of the original modelling tool (e.g. NONMEM).
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/campsisverse/campsisqual
